	(text "FAIL-SAFE:  with +3V3 absent U6 is unpowered, R_G2 holds Q2 off and R_G1 holds Q1's gate at its source, so +5V_XCVR is dead."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4bdd7932-7af2-4062-9dfd-c3cc49c741a8")
	)
	(text "SAFETY CHAIN:  +3V3 >= 3.08 V  ->  U6 RESET releases high  ->  Q2 on  ->  GATE pulled to GND  ->  Q1 on  ->  +5V_XCVR live."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5f85a6d9-065f-4a2c-9c53-bda9ad57707d")
	)
	(text "TIMING:  U6 holds RESET asserted ~200 ms after the rail is good; R_G1 * C_G then ramp Q1 on (inrush limit, R-HW-051)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 104 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9d6fd784-5eb8-42bc-91dd-efc261ab81b8")
	)
	(text "WHY:  the RP2354 fault-tolerant pads tolerate 5.5 V only while IOVDD is at 3.3 V, so U3/U4 must stay unpowered until +3V3 is good."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 100 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "dd61617a-e05e-4e3a-a5b0-5c5dca70f825")
	)
